            <h1 class="article-title">Why AI guardrails are not enough: the case for continuous agent monitoring</h1>
            <p class="article-summary">
                Pre-deployment safeguards establish how an AI agent should behave. Continuous assurance helps an organization verify that permissions, human intervention, and accountable behavior remain effective once real work begins.
            </p>
            <div class="article-author">
                <img alt="Savannah O. Kadima" class="article-author__avatar" width="56" height="56" src="/static/images/savannah_kadima_headshot.avif">
                <div>
